DESCRIPTION:PURCHASE TICKETS How will you mark the moment?Celebrate Jack L
 ondon’s 150th birthday with an evening inspired by his bold spirit\, big
  ideas\, and enduring love of this land.Join friends for a jubilant night 
 of food\, wine\, music\, and joy at the Park where legacy meets celebratio
 n and the story continues to unfold. We’ll toast to Jack’s extraordina
 ry life\, reflect on the dream he left behind\, and dance into what comes 
 next. It’s a birthday. It’s a milestone. It’s a bold wish.
